+/**
+ * GITSPACE PATCH — agents address models by ROLE, never by model id.
+ *
+ * Throws when `value` names a concrete model (`openai-codex/gpt-5.5`) rather
+ * than a role (`pi/smol`, optionally with a `:thinking` suffix). Roles are the
+ * single place an operator binds capability→model; a hardcoded model id in an
+ * agent-authored spawn silently opts out of that config, rots when model ids
+ * change (gpt-5.5 → gpt-5.6-luna), and makes spend unattributable to a role.
