+			`Available roles: ${knownRoles.map(role => `pi/${role}`).join(", ")}. ` +
+			`Roles are bound to models in settings, so this stays correct when models change. ` +
+			`Omit \`model\` to inherit the session's model, or use \`agent=<name>\` to pick a named subagent.`,
